<%- include('header') %><h1><%= business.name %></h1><p><%= business.relationship_status %> · SharePoint: <%= business.client_id||'Not linked' %></p><p>Customer status does not imply Managed IT coverage. Service obligations come from the authorized engagement and its agreements.</p>
<a class="button" href="/quick-quote?business_id=<%= business.id %>">New quote</a>
<%- include('quick-send-jobs') %><h2>Opportunities</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Opportunity</th><th>Type</th><th>Stage</th></tr></thead><tbody><% for(const p of opportunities){ %><tr><td><a href="/prospects/<%= p.id %>">OPP-<%= String(p.id).padStart(4,'0') %> · <%= p.opportunity_title||p.business_name %></a></td><td><%= engagementTypes[p.engagement_type]||'Legacy opportunity' %></td><td><%= p.stage %></td></tr><% } %></tbody></table>
<p>Open an opportunity to review its approved quotes, customer acceptance and sales handoff. Delivery is managed in your existing systems.</p><%- include('footer') %>
